OL,3,GNEWSAPotential for pine martens'
OL,4,Areturn, findings show
OL,5,
OL,6,FLead author Ella Lewis, nature-based
OL,7,Fsolutions and evidence officer for the
OL,8,Ftrust, said: "These new findings
OL,9,Fpresent the exciting potential for pine
OL,10,Fmartens to return to their former range
OL,11,Fin the future."
